Subject: [PATCH] VBA: Workbook properties, RefreshAll, sheet hyperlinks, FileDialog for both apps

BuiltinDocumentProperties and CustomDocumentProperties, ReadOnly, RefreshAll,
Protect Structure and Windows, Styles("Normal"), Next and Previous past the ends
give Nothing, Norm_S_Dist finds NORM.S.DIST, a sheet lists its hyperlinks, a style's
interior knows its document. The file dialog moves to vbahelper for Word to use.
